  "recreation_notes": [
    {
      "line_end": 9,
      "line_start": 1,
      "status": "candidate",
      "text": "Laser Cue / IPD No. 1414 / February, 1984 / 4 Players\nVersion 2.0 by UnclePaulie 2023\nOriginal table done by Goldchicco, however the playfield used wasn't aligned correctly, and the table size was incorrect.\nThis required the table to be completely redone.\nTable includes Hybrid VR/desktop/cabinet modes, new upscaled playfield, plastics, VPW physics, Fleep sounds, Lampz, 3D inserts, new GI, sling corrections, targets, etc.\n  Lots of options in the script, including various balls, VR options, LUT options, and a difficultly level to remove the one flipper guard rail.\nSignificant time was spent on researching online videos, to ensure accuracy of shots, ball drops, kickouts, playability.\nComplete implementation details found at the bottom of the script."
    }
  ],
